# Keep scratch/collateral out of the railway up build context.
# The 9/10 incident: uncommitted noise baked into the image silently.
deploy.sh
.railwayignore
*.md
!README.md
# skill/ IS a served asset, not collateral. The `*.md` rule above excludes EVERY
# markdown file from the image, which silently emptied /app/skill/agent-ledger/
# (SKILL.md) and dropped /app/recipes.md while both stayed green locally:
#   live MCP skills_list_tool -> {"skills":[]}   (non-empty on a dev box)
#   live GET /recipes.md      -> 404
# D-1313 adds skill/agent-ledger-buyer.md and serves it at GET /skill.md, so the
# directory must ship. Negation must come AFTER `*.md` (later rule wins).
!skill/*.md
!skill/**/*.md
tests/
.claude/
.claude-build-prompt-*.md
worktree-*.patch
archive-*